  "outlook": "Outlook for the Second Quarter Fiscal 2027: The Company expects net sales to be approximately $505.0 million to $515.0 million in the second quarter of fiscal 2027, compared to $455.3 million in the prior year, for a growth rate of 10.9% to 13.1%. Gross margin is expected to be in the range of 45.5% to 45.75% and SG&A as a percentage of net sales is expected to be in the range of 16.5% to 16.75%."
